    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 65,
      "text": "Knowledge carried in bamboo"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The Wang family hunt this mountain and they keep their knowledge on a beast skin. Not a treasure — working notes. Working notes are worth more.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "Restores the actual acquisition the old docs replaced with an abandoned camp. Coercion staged, violence cut away from.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "wang-da",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
      "op": "gesture",
      "actor": "wang-da",
      "gesture": "talk-point"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 66,
      "text": "Chapter 66"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Found the rest where they sleep between circuits. Cooking fire, two bowls, a portrait. One occupant, and he is proprietary about the mountain.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 67,
      "text": "Chapter 67"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Took the map. I will not write more than that. The cost was an afternoon and a decision I had already made before I walked up.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 68,
      "text": "Chapter 68"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Compared it against the copies the clan hands out. The circles on this one have been concealed on those. Somebody has been selling the mountain with pieces removed.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 69,
      "text": "Chapter 69"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The map separates animal territory from trap lines. A boar trail to the northeast, a hideout I was not meant to find, and two red circles I will not walk into until I know why they are circled.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "choice",
      "id": "act2.hunter.map.method",
      "prompt": "Choose the ground.",
      "method": "hunter",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "lure-ravine",
          "label": "The ravine. He will come.",
          "method": "lure-ravine"
        },
        {
          "id": "lure-grove",
          "label": "The thick of the grove, where sightlines are short.",
          "method": "lure-grove"
        },
        {
          "id": "withdraw",
          "label": "Go home and be seen going home.",
          "method": "withdraw"
